---
import PostHogLayout from '../layouts/PostHogLayout.astro';
---

<PostHogLayout>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Reflection Network</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
			<section class="hero">
				<h1>Reflection Network</h1>
				<p class="tagline">Become the founder of your AI-native company</p>
				<p class="description">Create, deploy, and manage a team of AI agents. Your agents. Your infrastructure. Your rules.</p>

				<div class="cta">
					<a href="https://docs.reflection.network" class="button">Docs</a>
					<a href="https://github.com/reflection-network" class="button button-secondary">GitHub</a>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="features">
				<div class="feature-card">
					<h2>Build your team</h2>
					<p>Define each agent's role, personality, and capabilities in a config file. No code needed — just declare who each agent is and what they can do.</p>
					<div class="status-row">
						<span class="badge badge-built">Built</span>
						<span class="status-text">Single agent</span>
						<span class="badge badge-soon">Coming Soon</span>
						<span class="status-text muted">Multi-agent team management</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="feature-card">
					<h2>Own everything</h2>
					<p>Your agents live in Git repos you control. Not locked to any platform, any vendor, any SDK. Fork, branch, version — standard dev workflow.</p>
					<div class="status-row">
						<span class="badge badge-built">Built</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="feature-card">
					<h2>Run anywhere, on anything</h2>
					<p>Our hosted platform, your VPS, your Mac Mini. OpenClaw, ZeroClaw, Claude Code — whatever runtime exists today or appears tomorrow, you plug it in with one line. Reflection defines who the agent is. The runtime underneath is a replaceable, constantly improving detail.</p>
					<div class="status-row">
						<span class="badge badge-built">Built</span>
						<span class="status-text">Self-hosted, 2 runtimes</span>
						<span class="badge badge-soon">Coming Soon</span>
						<span class="status-text muted">Hosted platform, more runtimes</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="feature-card">
					<h2>Your company evolves</h2>
					<p>Every change to an agent is a Git commit. Full history, instant rollback. Agents propose improvements to themselves via pull requests — you approve.</p>
					<div class="status-row">
						<span class="badge badge-built">Built</span>
						<span class="status-text">Version control</span>
						<span class="badge badge-soon">Coming Soon</span>
						<span class="status-text muted">Self-modification via PR</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="feature-card">
					<h2>You're the founder</h2>
					<p>You set the direction and bear the responsibility. Agents execute. Classical management principles applied to AI — delegation, oversight, accountability.</p>
					<div class="status-row">
						<span class="badge badge-soon">Coming Soon</span>
						<span class="status-text muted">Management tooling, observability</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="code-example">
				<pre><code>{`{
  inputs.agent-nix.url = "github:reflection-network/agent.nix";

  outputs = { self, agent-nix }:
    agent-nix.lib.mkAgent {
      agent = {
        name = "Ada";
        system-prompt = "You are Ada, a helpful assistant.";
      };
    };
}`}</code></pre>
			</section>

			<footer>
				<a href="https://docs.reflection.network">Docs</a>
				<a href="https://github.com/reflection-network">GitHub</a>
			</footer>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
</PostHogLayout>

<style>
	html, body {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		min-height: 100%;
	}

	body {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #0f3460 100%);
		font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
		color: #fff;
	}

	main {
		max-width: 640px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem;
	}

	.hero {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 4rem 0 3rem 0;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}

	.tagline {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
	}

	.description {
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
		margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
	}

	.cta {
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.button {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
		border-radius: 6px;
		color: #fff;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 1rem;
		transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
	}

	.button:hover {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
		border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
	}

	.button-secondary {
		background: transparent;
		border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
	}

	.cta .button + .button {
		margin-left: 0.75rem;
	}

	.features {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.feature-card {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		border-radius: 10px;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		text-align: left;
	}

	.feature-card h2 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
	}

	.feature-card p {
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
	}

	.status-row {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
	}

	.badge {
		padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.03em;
	}

	.badge-built {
		background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.15);
		color: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.9);
		border: 1px solid rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.25);
	}

	.badge-soon {
		background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.1);
		color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.7);
		border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2);
	}

	.status-text {
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
	}

	.status-text.muted {
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
	}

	.code-example {
		margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;
	}

	.code-example pre {
		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
		text-align: left;
		overflow-x: auto;
	}

	.code-example code {
		font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Fira Mono', monospace;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	footer {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 2rem 0;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	footer a {
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		transition: color 0.2s;
	}

	footer a:hover {
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		h1 {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}
		.tagline {
			font-size: 1rem;
		}
		.hero {
			padding: 2rem 0;
		}
	}
</style>
